<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-FILIPESCU GOES TO GALATASARAY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FILIPESCU GOES TO GALATASARAY.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romanian midfielder Iulian Filipescu's transfer from Steaua Bucharest to Galatasaray Istanbul of Turkey has been finalised.</p>
<p>The deal was completed after Galatasaray increased their original offer of $800,000 to $950,000.</p>
<p>Filipescu joins two other members of Romania's national team, captain Gheorghe Hagi and Adrian Ilie, at Galatasaray.</p>
